{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '235,291p' tests/test_accounting_p02.py; sed -n '786,818p' scripts/apple_case_v1.py; sed -n '70,88p' data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02/result.md\"","aggregated_output":"    def test_raw_note_boundaries_and_duplicate_ids_reject(self):\n        raw = INTERIM_HTML.read_text()\n        variants = [\n            (raw.replace(\">Note 2 &#8211;\", \">Note 1 &#8211;\", 1), \"missing, duplicate or reordered raw note headings\"),\n            (raw.replace(\">Note 2 &#8211;\", \">Removed 2 &#8211;\", 1), \"missing, duplicate or reordered raw note headings\"),\n            (re.sub(r\"Item 2\\.(?:&#160;)+Management\", \"Removed Management\", raw), \"raw final note boundary missing\"),\n        ]\n        with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory(prefix=\"p02-raw-notes-\") as directory:\n            root = Path(directory)\n            for content, message in variants:\n                (root / \"interim.html\").write_text(content)\n                with patch.object(case, \"ROOT\", root):\n                    doc = case.Document(\"interim\", \"interim.html\", \"interim.html\")\n                    with self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, message):\n                        case.raw_note_ranges(doc)\n            fid = self.by_id[\"interim.bs.2024-12-28.assets\"][\"source_readings\"][0][\"fact_id\"]\n            (root / \"interim.html\").write_text(raw + '<div id=\"' + fid + '\"></div>')\n            with patch.object(case, \"ROOT\", root):\n                doc = case.Document(\"interim\", \"interim.html\", \"interim.html\")\n                with self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, \"duplicate HTML/XBRL id\"):\n                    case.InlineReader(doc)\n\n    def test_inline_repeated_readings_and_dimension_mutations(self):\n        obs = self.by_id[\"interim.bs.2024-12-28.assets\"]\n        source = obs[\"source_readings\"][0]\n        fact = copy.copy(self.reader.ids[source[\"fact_id\"]])\n        fact[\"id\"] = \"p02_duplicate_reading\"\n        fact.string = \"999\"\n        reader = self.reader_with_raw(self.reader.raw + str(fact))\n        with self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, \"conflicting repeated readings\"):\n            reader.select(obs[\"concept\"], obs[\"context\"], obs[\"measurement\"], \"conflict\")\n        ctx = copy.copy(next(x for x in self.reader.ids.values() if x.name == \"xbrli:context\" and x.find(\"xbrldi:explicitmember\")))\n        member = ctx.find(\"xbrldi:explicitmember\")\n        member.insert_after(copy.copy(member))\n        with self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, \"duplicate/missing dimension\"):\n            self.reader.parse_context(ctx)\n        reader = self.reader_with_raw(self.reader.raw)\n        fact = reader.ids[source[\"fact_id\"]]\n        fact[\"id\"] = \"missing-fact-id\"\n        with self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, \"raw ID anchor missing/ambiguous\"):\n            reader.parse(fact)\n        reader = self.reader_with_raw(self.reader.raw.replace(\"iso4217:USD\", \"iso4217:EUR\"))\n        with self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, \"unsupported currency/unit\"):\n            reader.parse(reader.ids[source[\"fact_id\"]])\n        raw_fact = source[\"fact\"][\"quote\"]\n        for change, message in [(raw_fact.replace('scale=\"6\"', 'scale=\"3\"'), \"wrong presentation scale/precision\"),\n                                (raw_fact.replace('scale=\"6\"', 'sign=\"-\" scale=\"6\"'), \"rendered/tagged sign mismatch\")]:\n            reader = self.reader_with_raw(self.reader.raw.replace(raw_fact, change))\n            with self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, message):\n                reader.select(obs[\"concept\"], obs[\"context\"], obs[\"measurement\"], \"mutated\")\n        for key, value in [(\"entity\", \"0000000001\"), (\"period\", {\"instant\": \"2024-12-27\"})]:\n            ctx = copy.deepcopy(obs[\"context\"])\n            ctx[key] = value\n            with self.subTest(key=key), self.assertRaisesRegex(case.CaseError, \"missing required fact/context\"):\n                self.reader.select(obs[\"concept\"], ctx, obs[\"measurement\"], \"wrong-context\")\n\n    def test_context_and_measurement_rejection_reasons(self):\ndef rendered_row_match(doc, label, occurrence=0, column=0):\n    \"\"\"Parse a row independently in a dated issuer statement table.\"\"\"\n    revenue = label == \"Total net sales\"\n    title = \"CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS\" if revenue else \"CONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEETS\"\n    stop = \"CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF COMPREHENSIVE INCOME\" if revenue else \"CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF SHAREHOLDERS\"\n    start = doc.text.find(title)\n    end = doc.text.find(stop, start + len(title))\n    require(start >= 0 and end > start, \"issuer statement boundary missing\")\n    section = doc.text[start:end]\n    require(\"In millions\" in section, \"issuer statement scale missing\")\n    dates = re.findall(r\"(September \\d+,)\\s*(20\\d{2})\", section)\n    expected = [(\"September 28,\", \"2024\"), (\"September 30,\", \"2023\")]\n    if revenue:\n        expected.append((\"September 24,\", \"2022\"))\n    require(dates[:len(expected)] == expected and 0 <= column < len(expected), \"issuer period/column mismatch\")\n    lines = list(re.finditer(r\"[^\\n]+\", section))\n    rows = [i for i, line in enumerate(lines) if line[0] == label]\n    require(len(rows) == (2 if label == \"Term debt\" else 1), \"ambiguous issuer row\")\n    require(0 <= occurrence < len(rows), \"issuer row occurrence\")\n    values = []\n    j = rows[occurrence] + 1\n    while j < len(lines) and len(values) < len(expected):\n        literal = lines[j][0]\n        if literal != \"$\":\n            number(literal)\n            values.append(lines[j])\n        j += 1\n    require(len(values) == len(expected), \"issuer table column count\")\n    cell = values[column]\n    return doc.anchor(start + cell.start(), start + cell.end()), cell[0]\n\n\ndef policy_records(annual, interim, notes):\n| Outstanding obligation | Specific missing evidence and next legitimate route |\n|---|---|\n| Annual Exhibit 4.2, April 29, 2013 indenture | Full terms/applicability uninspected; accession 0001193125-13-179942, d527270dex41, via SEC or issuer archive. |\n| Annual Exhibit 4.19, November 5, 2018 indenture | Full terms/applicability uninspected; accession 0001193125-18-317844, d644900dex41. |\n| Series certificates, including 4.27/4.28 | August 8, 2022 and May 10, 2023 certificates indexed but not acquired; routes 0001193125-22-214914 and 0001140361-23-023909. Current allocations, amendments and swap confirmations remain unknown. |\n| Item 601(b)(4)(iii) omitted instruments | Filing expressly omits instruments; identities/terms cannot be invented. Inspect identifiable public issuer/SEC filings; no outreach. |\n| Remaining proxy/exhibit semantics | Inspect retained proxy sections and exact case-index targets; index links and selected passages do not close incorporation. |\n| Historical versions | Filing/acceptance metadata and 2026 retrieval do not establish historical availability of these exact bytes. Seek archived byte-specific evidence; selected-cell agreement is insufficient. |\n\nMissing contract evidence prevents complete debt-contract reconstruction. Debt/swap allocation and resets, noncash debt movements, asset cohorts and contingent outcomes remain unidentified. Notional is not recast as floating-rate exposure; management's loss assessment is not a zero liability or probability distribution. No company forecast is generated.\n\n## Decision and limits\n\n| Decision | Primary criterion | Veto status | Main uncertainty | Next justified action | Not concluded |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Submit bounded implementation for review | Dispositions, bridges and independent/adversarial checks pass | No remaining observed mandatory-check failure | Further source/annotation defects remain possible | Review actual adapter, tests and case | Whole-gap or semantic closure |\n| Retain selected accounting identities | Source readings and exact arithmetic/rounding checks pass | Source/context/measurement mutations reject | Histories and issuer rounding tie rule | Extend only with sourced evidence | Accounting compliance or fully identified company history |\n| Keep incorporation/version obligations open | Specific targets and missing evidence retained | Missing terms veto dependent claims | Series terms and historical byte availability | Follow exact public routes | Complete agreement package or historical publication equivalence |\n| Forecast/human acceptance pending | No forecast criterion evaluated | No promotion claimed | Predictive performance and human acceptance unevaluated | Independent result review | Forecast validity or human acceptance |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
